  "description": "\"I want to seduce the Team Leader.\"   \n\n\"Are you saying you want to sleep with me?\"  \n\n\"I don't think that's... impossible.\"  \n\nStepping over the line drawn by Cha Moo-hyuk was purely out of revenge. It was a small, personal vendetta—to seduce the man loved by the woman who cheated with my ex-boyfriend and hurt them both. However, Cha Moo-hyuk was no easy target. Because of the burning passion hidden behind his ascetic face, my entire life has been shaken to its core.\n\nWas crossing that line the right thing to do?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \nR19: [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/69489098), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%B0%A4%EC%9D%98-%ED%8C%80%EC%9E%A5%EB%8B%98-19%EC%84%B8-%EC%99%84%EC%A0%84%ED%8C%90/4889)   \nR15: [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/69490327)",
